{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"13279","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13279","key":"MC-188602","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"11/Jun/20 12:49 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>In a custom dimension, if the dimension type has <tt>natural</tt> set to false and <tt>bed_works</tt> set to true, using a bed does not explode, but it does not skip the night or set the player's spawn point either.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce%3A\"></a>How to reproduce:</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Create a new world with the attached data pack (<span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/18189\" title=\"MC-188602.zip attached to MC-188602\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"MC-188602.zip\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"fa0794be-82df-4a9e-9c51-078029dda5fd\" rel=\"noreferrer\">MC-188602.zip<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span>).</li>\n\t<li>Go to the nether or the end.</li>\n\t<li>Place a bed down.</li>\n\t<li>Use the bed.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresult%3A\"></a>Expected result:</h3>\n<p>The bed would set my spawn point, but probably not skip the night as the dimension has \"natural\" set to false.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Observedresult%3A\"></a>Observed result:</h3>\n<p>The bed did not do anything.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"Originaldescription%3A\"></a>Original description:</h3>\n<p>I made a custom world where what I expected to happen was:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>In the Overworld, beds explode and respawn anchors set your spawn point.</li>\n\t<li>In the Nether, beds set your spawn point and respawn anchors explode.</li>\n\t<li>In the End, beds and respawn anchors set your spawn point.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>However, what actually happened was:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>In the Overworld, beds exploded and respawn anchors did nothing (1.16.5)/actually set your spawn point (21w18a).</li>\n\t<li>In the Nether, beds did nothing and respawn anchors exploded.</li>\n\t<li>In the End, beds did nothing and respawn anchors did actually set my spawn point.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>I have attached the world settings and a video that shows some of the results.</p>\n\n<p>Additionally, these errors appear in the output log when attempting to set your spawn (1.16.5)</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>Error executing task on Client\njava.lang.NullPointerException\n\tat afr.a(SourceFile:128)\n\tat afr.a(SourceFile:142)\n\tat dkv.b(SourceFile:1202)\n\tat dkv.a(SourceFile:1216)\n\tat dwu.a(SourceFile:870)\n\tat pb.a(SourceFile:41)\n\tat pb.a(SourceFile:11)\n\tat ol.a(SourceFile:21)\n\tat ol$$Lambda$4750/782440233.run(Unknown Source)\n\tat aob.c(SourceFile:144)\n\tat aof.c(SourceFile:23)\n\tat aob.y(SourceFile:118)\n\tat aob.bl(SourceFile:103)\n\tat djz.e(SourceFile:1015)\n\tat djz.e(SourceFile:681)\n\tat net.minecraft.client.main.Main.main(SourceFile:215)\n</pre>\n</div></div>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"11/Jun/20 10:23 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/18187","id":"18187","filename":"1.18-pre4_respawn_points_reversed.json","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas